      ":question/problem": "Determine the number of pivot columns of the matrix $D,$ given by\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 & 1 & -1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 2 & 1 & -1 \\\\ -3 & -1 & -5 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 6 & 4 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$",
